OL,3,GNEWSABlack Sabbath film difficult to
OL,4,Awatch, says Iommi
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlack Sabbath guitarist Tony Iommi said
OL,7,Fa new film of the band's last ever
OL,8,Fperformance was "emotional" and
OL,9,F"difficult to watch".
OL,11,FThe legendary heavy metal group's Back
OL,12,FTo The Beginning gig at Villa Park in
OL,13,FBirmingham last year has been turned
OL,14,Finto a movie and will be released next
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FIommi co-founded the band in the 60s
OL,18,Falongside Ozzy Osbourne, who died two
OL,19,Fweeks after the concert, aged 76,
OL,20,FTerence "Geezer" Butler and Bill Ward.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
